---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — GeoSmart" description="Contact Camila Fernández for geological collaborations, student opportunities, science communication and professional conversations.">
<section class="page-hero contact-hero"><div class="contact-grid-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">Let's connect</div><h1>Contact</h1><p class="muted">Interested in geology, science communication, collaboration or a professional opportunity? I'd be glad to hear from you.</p><div class="contact-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">40° N · 3° W → 63° N · 10° E</div></div></section>
<section class="page contact-page"><div class="container"><div class="contact-intro"><span class="section-kicker">Open channel</span><p>Good conversations can start with a question, a project, a map or simply a “hey, I found your work interesting.”</p></div><div class="contact-box contact-box-large"><div class="contact-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="contact-stamp" aria-hidden="true">GEO<br />SMART</div><div class="section-kicker">Get in touch</div><h2>Let's talk geology.</h2><p>Maybe you have a project in mind, an interesting geological question, an academic opportunity, a collaboration idea — or simply found something on GeoSmart worth talking about. I'm always happy to hear from curious people.</p><div class="contact-details"><a href="mailto:c.fernandez@geosmart.es"><span>Email</span><strong>c.fernandez@geosmart.es</strong><small>Best for professional enquiries</small></a><a href="tel:+34640118331"><span>Phone</span><strong>+34 640 118 331</strong><small>Spain · international calls welcome</small></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/camila-isabel-fernández-riveras-190b4a384/es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>LinkedIn</span><strong>Camila Fernández</strong><small>Professional profile</small></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/_geomila_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Science outreach</span><strong>@_geomila_</strong><small>Geology, curiosity &amp; science</small></a></div></div><div class="section-head contact-open" style="margin-top:70px;margin-bottom:0"><div><div class="section-kicker">What I'm open to</div><h2>Good conversations can start anywhere.</h2></div><p class="muted">Academic collaborations · student opportunities · geoscience projects · science outreach · international work · ideas worth exploring.</p></div><div class="contact-signoff"><span>GEO · SMART</span><p>Read the Earth. Ask better questions.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.contact-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6efe7,#fffdf9 48%,#e8f0ec)}.contact-hero::before{content:'@';position:absolute;right:8%;top:8%;color:rgba(15,61,62,.06);font:600 16rem/1 'Playfair Display',serif}.contact-hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:-70px;bottom:-100px;width:260px;height:260px;border:2px solid rgba(245,130,32,.22);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 24px rgba(245,130,32,.035),0 0 0 48px rgba(15,61,62,.025)}.contact-grid-lines{position:absolute;right:17%;bottom:15%;width:180px;height:110px;opacity:.18;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 28px,var(--green) 29px 30px),repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 25px,var(--orange) 26px 27px);transform:skewY(-10deg)}.contact-coordinate{margin-top:30px;color:rgba(15,61,62,.5);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em}.contact-intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:40px;margin-bottom:34px}.contact-intro p{max-width:620px;margin:0;color:#69706d;font:500 1.2rem/1.45 'Playfair Display',serif}.contact-box-large{position:relative;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(15,61,62,.16);background:linear-gradient(125deg,var(--green-deep),var(--green) 68%,#285e58)}.contact-box-large::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-120px;bottom:-160px;width:360px;height:360px;border:2px solid rgba(245,130,32,.18);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 25px rgba(245,130,32,.04),0 0 0 52px rgba(255,255,255,.02)}.contact-orbit{position:absolute;right:8%;top:12%;width:170px;height:170px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:50%;opacity:.75}.contact-orbit::before,.contact-orbit::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:19px;border:1px solid rgba(245,130,32,.24);border-radius:50%}.contact-orbit::after{inset:48px}.contact-orbit span{position:absolute;width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--orange);border-radius:50%}.contact-orbit span:nth-child(1){top:12px;left:80px}.contact-orbit span:nth-child(2){right:15px;bottom:43px}.contact-orbit span:nth-child(3){left:35px;bottom:15px}.contact-stamp{position:absolute;right:10%;bottom:11%;z-index:2;width:68px;height:68px;border:1px solid rgba(245,130,32,.65);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;color:rgba(245,130,32,.85);font-size:.5rem;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;transform:rotate(12deg)}.contact-details{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);position:relative;z-index:3}.contact-details a{transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,.045)}.contact-details a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(245,130,32,.6)}.contact-details small{color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-size:.68rem}.contact-signoff{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:28px 4px 0;color:#69706d}.contact-signoff span{color:var(--orange);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em}.contact-signoff p{margin:0;font:italic 1.15rem 'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--green)}
/* BOLDER EDITORIAL PASS */
.contact-page{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffdf9 0%,#f6efe7 100%);position:relative}.contact-page::before{content:'GEO · SMART · CONNECT';position:absolute;left:2.5rem;top:8rem;writing-mode:vertical-rl;color:rgba(15,61,62,.14);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em}.contact-intro{padding:10px 0 24px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--green)}.contact-box-large{border-radius:0 48px 0 48px;padding:52px 55px;min-height:520px}.contact-box-large h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem);max-width:650px}.contact-box-large>p{max-width:700px;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.65}.contact-details{gap:12px;margin-top:38px}.contact-details a{border-radius:0 18px 0 18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding:22px}.contact-details a strong{font-size:1rem}.contact-open{padding-top:40px}.contact-signoff{padding-bottom:35px}.contact-signoff p{font-size:1.3rem}.contact-page::after{content:'✦';position:absolute;right:4%;bottom:6rem;color:var(--orange);font-size:2rem}
@media(max-width:800px){.contact-page::before{display:none}.contact-box-large{padding:32px 25px;border-radius:0 30px 0 30px;min-height:0}.contact-details{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contact-orbit{opacity:.45}.contact-stamp{right:18px;bottom:20px}.contact-signoff{display:block}.contact-signoff p{margin-top:8px}}
.contact-hero{isolation:isolate;min-height:430px;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,42,43,.8) 0%,rgba(15,61,62,.56) 38%,rgba(15,61,62,.16) 76%,rgba(15,61,62,.08) 100%),url('/images/contact.png');background-position:center;background-size:cover}
.contact-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,42,43,.1),transparent 45%,rgba(7,42,43,.28))}
.contact-hero .container{position:relative;z-index:1}
.contact-hero .section-kicker{color:#f6c28f}
.contact-hero h1{color:#fff}
.contact-hero .muted{max-width:600px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86)}
.contact-hero .contact-coordinate{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}
@media(max-width:800px){.contact-hero{min-height:360px;background-position:58% center;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,42,43,.86) 0%,rgba(15,61,62,.64) 48%,rgba(15,61,62,.18) 100%),url('/images/contact.png')}}
</style>